                                                               "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/65/Iliac_veins.gif"^^xsd:anyURI .


###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001322
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001322> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001021> ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
