                                                                  owl:someValuesFrom <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001394>
                                                                ] ;
                                                <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "The thoracoacromial artery (acromiothoracic artery; thoracic axis) is a short trunk, which arises from the forepart of the axillary artery, its origin being generally overlapped by the upper edge of the Pectoralis minor. [WP,unvetted]." ;
